Performance patch for justbustin/minecraft-crossover-bridge at d1723873ec (MIT, see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). Apply in the bridge clone with `git apply`, then rebuild and install
(elden-ring/scripts/install_er_bridge.sh, or reload_core.sh while the game runs).

- memutil.cpp: mem_readable caches the regions VirtualQuery confirmed, for one game tick
  (mem_cache_reset() at the start of task_tick). Under Wine and Rosetta each query is a slow
  system call, and publishing entities made thousands a tick: 8.5 ms -> 0.1 ms in the Stranded
  Graveyard, Elden Ring 25 -> 36 fps.
- game.cpp: a "tick breakdown (ms)" log line every 300 ticks, per section.

